  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "So there's still no sign of the crater left after@the Garden of Baral rose up...@Are you sure the coordinates are correct?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "XO, launch the G-Compatible Kaiser@and have it search the area.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Captain, a report from Lieutenant Kusuha Mizuha,@on standby for launch. She says RyuKoOh@has grown more wary.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Meaning there's something here?@I'll speak with Lieutenant Kusuha directly. Patch her in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "This is the captain. Let's hear your view, Lieutenant.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Yes, sir. The <Garden of Baral> was the <Baral>'s home...@There must have been many <Yokijin>@under their command there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "This is just my guess, but there may be the wreckage@of a Yokijin plant or something underground,@and RyuKoOh might be sensing it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Hmm...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "I'd hardly call that the best answer.@It doesn't explain why the ruins can't be seen.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Maybe it's cleverly camouflaged@precisely because something is there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "There's no proof that's Debudedabide's doing.@Lieutenant Kusuha, can't you ask RyuKoOh directly?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "I-I'm sorry.@We can't always talk back and forth...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "...If the Lieutenant's guess is right,@were the ghosts the survey team saw@Yokijin, not Lamaris?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Then wouldn't they have reported as much?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Commander. I'll also launch RyuKoOh to scout@around the target point. Any objection?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Mm.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "This is what's left of the Baral's home... Even with@<Gan Eden> and its main parts gone, I figured we'd sense@some lingering trace of will or something this close.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "According to the legends of the <Great Mech War>,@this place is tied to the fates of@KoRyuOh and RyuKoOh too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "And Irui was once here, too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "She wouldn't be here, would she...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "If she were, we'd be able to tell.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Roa",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Kota, check what's ahead with the Kaiser Scanner.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Yep.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "What the?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Aah, Yokijin!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "So they were still here, just like Kusuha thought?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Those things sure don't look like wreckage!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "There are Personal Troopers@and Armored Modules mixed in too!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "There's no one aboard them.@They're being controlled by Madnet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Which means Debudedabide is@at the Garden of Baral's ruins...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Got a reading on the scanner.@Looks like some kind of barrier's up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "If we hit it with a burst of high energy,@we could trigger crystallization and@physically destroy it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Commander, we'll destroy the barrier@with this ship's Tronium Buster Cannon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "All mobile units, launch!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units.@The Hagane cannot move while prepping the Buster@Cannon. Keep the enemy away until it fires.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Hey, in a spot like that?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "They're after the Hagane.@They seem to know what we're@planning to do.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "All units, keep the enemy away from the Hagane!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "60 seconds until the Tronium@Buster Cannon fires!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Get our units out of the line of fire.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Roger!@Steel 2 to all units! Clear the Buster Cannon's@line of fire immediately!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "10 seconds to firing!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "All hands, brace for impact and flash!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "5 seconds to firing! Final safety released!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Enemy unit in the line of fire!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Never mind! Fire!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
